      <p>The waking world demands your attention — work, relationships, responsibilities, survival.<br />
      The dream world asks for something quieter — reflection, curiosity, interpretation, meaning.</p>

      <p>Most people ignore their dreams.<br />
      But you didn’t.<br />
      You came here.</p>

